{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the <strong>lord and commander of your town</strong>, you'll need to <strong>defend it from swarming enemies</strong>, <strong>upgrade buildings</strong>, and <strong>train soldiers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with <strong>NPCs within your town to trigger events</strong>, <strong>acquire various heroes</strong>, and ultimately <strong>achieve the grand feat of unifying the continent</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897130/extras/998cdbf85b76efe2846942e6c075ecc8.avif?t=1754071582\" width=1600 height=716 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897130/extras/3c15685c31978acbccee7fd05b5c0472.avif?t=1754071582\" width=1600 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when idle, you can continuously acquire resources by defending against enemies and mining. These resources can be used to produce soldiers or upgrade buildings, gradually building a stronger town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>battle waves</strong> and <strong>various limited-time events</strong>, then <strong>conquer the world map</strong> by <strong>occupying other towns</strong> and <strong>training more soldiers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge event stages</strong> across <strong>different worldviews</strong>, <strong>collect heroes</strong>, and become the <strong>strongest lord and commander</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a path of conquest</strong>, <strong>unify all factions in the world</strong>, and <strong>achieve ultimate supremacy</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897130?t=1754071582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897130/6625eb98a8a8a61effca0851e0c50ad897f78084/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754071582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897130/57dbef3b95de9a25be92e00ec4659eb7fbea5920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754071582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897130/57dbef3b95de9a25be92e00ec4659eb7fbea5920/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754071582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the <strong>lord and commander of your town</strong>, you'll need to <strong>defend it from swarming enemies</strong>, <strong>upgrade buildings</strong>, and <strong>train soldiers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with <strong>NPCs within your town to trigger events</strong>, <strong>acquire various heroes</strong>, and ultimately <strong>achieve the grand feat of unifying the continent</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897130/extras/998cdbf85b76efe2846942e6c075ecc8.avif?t=1754071582\" width=1600 height=716 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897130/extras/3c15685c31978acbccee7fd05b5c0472.avif?t=1754071582\" width=1600 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when idle, you can continuously acquire resources by defending against enemies and mining. These resources can be used to produce soldiers or upgrade buildings, gradually building a stronger town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>battle waves</strong> and <strong>various limited-time events</strong>, then <strong>conquer the world map</strong> by <strong>occupying other towns</strong> and <strong>training more soldiers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge event stages</strong> across <strong>different worldviews</strong>, <strong>collect heroes</strong>, and become the <strong>strongest lord and commander</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a path of conquest</strong>, <strong>unify all factions in the world</strong>, and <strong>achieve ultimate supremacy</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["NearDream"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897130/6cc8184e1603192f28b6eff327ae844d66426e53/header.jpg?t=1754071582","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897130/488538259/0e3d07be3c16df9d4c7f306a09a2c61bc28838de/1753106618/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754071581","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897130/488538259/0e3d07be3c16df9d4c7f306a09a2c61bc28838de/1753106618/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754071581","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897130/488538259/0e3d07be3c16df9d4c7f306a09a2c61bc28838de/1753106618/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754071581","id":257171860,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171860/movie480.mp4?t=1754071581","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171860/movie_max.mp4?t=1754071581"},"name":"CastleHearts_Episode0","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257171860/b60b868ab2080cb8aa2f9e4c411d333cf1f00aae/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754071581","webm